A description at a pulled block's column ends it below an indented plus

```
:: t
 : +
l
: b
.
<dl>
  <dt>t</dt>
  <dd>+
l</dd>
  <dd>b</dd>
</dl>
```

```
:: t
 : +
> q
: b
.
<dl>
  <dt>t</dt>
  <dd>+</dd>
</dl>
<blockquote><p>q
: b</p></blockquote>
```

```
:: t
  :  +
l
: b
.
<dl>
  <dt>t</dt>
  <dd>+
l</dd>
  <dd>b</dd>
</dl>
```

```
- x

  :: t
   : +
  l
  : b
.
<ul>
  <li>x
    <dl>
      <dt>t</dt>
      <dd>+
l</dd>
      <dd>b</dd>
    </dl>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
